ixture and equipment services to commercial cinema exhibitors for new construction and remodels, including design, consulting, and procurement of seats, screen systems, lighting, acoustical treatments, screens, projection, and sound equipment for upgrades and new professional cinema, screening room, postproduction facilities and ultra-high-end cinema builds. Moving iMage Technologies, Inc. is headquartered in Fountain Valley, California."}}